  - src/image_preprocessing_detector/classification/pdf_image_detector.py (194 lines)
  - src/image_preprocessing_detector/classification/pdf_text_extractor.py (122 lines)
  - src/routing/document_type_router.py (planned — promotes above to Stage 0)

  **Purpose:**
  - Classify as image_only/born_digital/born_digital_degraded/hybrid
  - Detect if PDF contains images
  - Extract text + validate quality for born-digital detection
  - born_digital_degraded: text layer present but extraction yields garbage
    (~18% of born-digital PDFs per PDF Association 2025)

  **Classes (4-way):**
  - image_only: Scanned documents
  - born_digital: Digital PDFs with valid text layer
  - born_digital_degraded: Corrupt text layer → falls back to image pipeline
  - hybrid: Mix of scanned and digital pages (per-page routing)

  **Total:** 472 lines (existing) + Stage 0 router (planned)
end note

