partition "MobileNetV4-Conv-S (Pre-Correction)" {
  :Run MobileNetV4-Conv-S (3 heads);
  note left
    **Source Files:**
    - src/image_preprocessing_detector/detection/mobilenetv4_precorrection.py (planned)
    - src/image_preprocessing_detector/detection/stage_gate.py (planned)

    **Model:**
    - MobileNetV4-Conv-S (~4M params)
    - 3 heads: orientation (4-class), skew (±10° reg), resolution quality (0-1 reg)

    **Device Selection:**
    - Local GPU (preferred, ~3ms)
    - Modal GPU (fallback, ~5ms)
    - CPU (last resort, 8-12ms)

    **Documentation:**
    [[level-3/production-runtime/device-orchestrator.md]]
  end note

  :Apply pre-corrections\n(orientation, deskew, resolution);
}

partition "SigLIP 2 NAFlex (Multi-Task Analysis)" {
  :Run SigLIP 2 NAFlex (22 heads, 5 groups);
  note left
    **Source File:**
    - src/image_preprocessing_detector/detection/siglip2_multitask.py

    **Model:**
    - SigLIP 2 NAFlex (88M params)
    - 22 heads across 5 groups:
      G1: IQA (6 heads: blur/noise/contrast/skew/compression + overall)
      G2: Script (3 heads: script_code + has_non_latin + has_rtl)
      G3: Orientation+Skew (3 heads: cls + reg + confidence)
      G4: Handwriting (5 heads: 3 cls + 2 reg)
      G5: Page Attrs (5 heads: capture_cls + shadow/warping/code/resolution_quality)

    **Device:**
    - Local GPU (~50ms)
    - Modal GPU (~60ms)
    - CPU (~150ms)
  end note

  if (Any head confidence below threshold?) then (yes)
    :Classical fallback (6 head-specific rules);
